        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of card mathematics in this unique arcade deckbuilder where every number counts.<br><br>Each round presents you with a target score that you must bring below zero. Using value cards, modifier cards, and special effect cards from your deck, you'll stack them strategically to combine their effects. The math is simple but the strategy runs deep - every card placement matters. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/7c87eea15cbc7a1a7ad1efd545ba0589.poster.avif?t=1759995065\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/7c87eea15cbc7a1a7ad1efd545ba0589.webm?t=1759995065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/7c87eea15cbc7a1a7ad1efd545ba0589.mp4?t=1759995065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, visit the shop to acquire powerful new cards and choose your next target score. Higher targets mean greater rewards, but require more careful planning. Even when you fail, the points earned level you up through 16 progression tiers, unlocking new cards and different deck types. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/b773cc83e8a3834c2463000aabb2b6b9.poster.avif?t=1759995065\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/b773cc83e8a3834c2463000aabb2b6b9.webm?t=1759995065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/b773cc83e8a3834c2463000aabb2b6b9.mp4?t=1759995065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While victory comes after 10 rounds, the real challenge is seeing how far you can push your score. Each playthrough offers new opportunities to experiment with different card combinations and discover optimal strategies.<br><br><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergistic card-stacking scoring system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 levels of progression with new unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk/reward target selection system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic deck building through shop upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless scoring potential beyond the 10-round campaign<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/72e04d0a65a5be1bfa4a65fcbee27c89.poster.avif?t=1759995065\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/72e04d0a65a5be1bfa4a65fcbee27c89.webm?t=1759995065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/72e04d0a65a5be1bfa4a65fcbee27c89.mp4?t=1759995065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
