p4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While victory comes after 10 rounds, the real challenge is seeing how far you can push your score. Each playthrough offers new opportunities to experiment with different card combinations and discover optimal strategies.<br><br><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergistic card-stacking scoring system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 levels of progression with new unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk/reward target selection system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic deck building through shop upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless scoring potential beyond the 10-round campaign<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/72e04d0a65a5be1bfa4a65fcbee27c89.poster.avif?t=1759995065\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/72e04d0a65a5be1bfa4a65fcbee27c89.webm?t=1759995065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040220/extras/72e04d0a65a5be1bfa4a65fcbee27c89.mp4?t=1759995065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
